# Product Inventory & Pricing Analysis Dashboard

**Project Type:** Data Analytics & Business Intelligence

**Tools Used:** Microsoft Power BI, Power Query

## Project Overview
Developed an interactive Power BI dashboard to analyze product inventory, stock distribution across categories, and product pricing. The dashboard brings important metrics and comparisons together in one place to support faster, data-informed decisions.

## Key Features
- **KPI Cards:** Display total stock, product count, and average product price.
- **Stock Distribution by Category:** Compare stock quantities across different categories.
- **Product Price Comparison:** Compare prices across individual products.
- **Interactive Category Slicer:** Filter dashboard visuals by product category.
- **Data Preparation:** Used Power Query to prepare and transform data for reporting.

## Business Value
The dashboard helps users monitor inventory levels, compare product prices, and quickly identify differences across categories and products.

## Project Deliverables
- Editable Power BI report (.pbix)
- PDF dashboard report (.pdf)

